   "html": "<p>Beats by Dre and IHEARTCOMIX launched a livestream special at the height of the pandemic titled RELEASED! Hosted by Zack Fox and creatively directed by Kitao Sakurai (<em>The Eric Andre Show, Bad Trip</em>), the one off starred Phoebe Bridgers celebrating her just released album, <em>Punisher</em>. Featuring live performances, special guests and an absurd premise, fans cooped up due to quarantine from around the world were able to watch and interact through this one-of-a-kind virtual experience on Twitch.</p>\n<p>IHEARTCOMIX spearheaded the project from the top down, developing the concept for Beats By Dre with a defined marketing and PR plan, and executing a Covid-safe production. The results were millions of social hits and tons of press coverage in outlets such as <a href=\"https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-news/phoebe-bridgers-twitch-livestream-1025570/\"><strong>Rolling Stone</strong></a>, <a href=\"https://pitchfork.com/news/phoebe-bridgers-set-for-first-episode-of-zack-fox-new-show-released-watch-the-promo/\"><strong>Pitchfork</strong></a>, <a href=\"https://www.stereogum.com/2091193/phoebe-bridgers-released-zack-fox-twitch-show/news/\"><strong>Stereogum</strong></a> and many more.</p>"
  }
 ],
