  {
   "title": "PREMISE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Zack Fox is just another dude living on Planet Ass. Always at the mercy of his pet dog with an attitude, Marlo, and an overbearing alien landlord. Zack often finds himself trying to figure his way out of precarious situations. The best he can do is hop in his Mad Max-style ‘95 Corolla and go on quests across the universe. In the premiere episode, Phoebe Bridgers and Zack join forces to gather the ingredients across several planets to make a punch for Phoebe’s prom performance on Cyber Goth Forest world.</p>"
    },
