  {
   "title": "PRODUCTION",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Comprised of real-time live-puppeted animation, 3D green screen sets, music performances and pre-made segments, IHC produced the live, improvised show while following COVID safety standards. Fans were eager to interact with Zack and Phoebe as they played along in the Twitch chat talking about their favorite tracks on the new album, reacting to the story unfolding in the stream and using custom emotes created just for the episode.</p>\n<p>‍</p>"
