  {
   "title": "CYBER GOTH PROM FAN CONTEST",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Leading up to the broadcast, we hosted a contest exclusively for Phoebe Bridgers’ fans to ‘attend’ the cyber goth prom finale in the show. Fans submitted videos dressed up in their best “Cyber Goth Prom” look for a chance to win autographed Beats By Dre headphones, a Punisher vinyl LP and their very own skeleton costume.</p>"
